One-time setup, in the project folder

npm install
pip install flask flask-cors


Terminal 1: the main app

Port 5000 is taken by the chatbot server, so the main app has to run on a different port.

Windows (Command Prompt):
set PORT=3000 && npm run dev
Windows (PowerShell):
$env:PORT=3000; npm run dev

Terminal 2: the chatbot server

Open a new terminal window, go to the same project folder, then run:

cd backend
python app.py
